Cell["\<\
Assumtions eXt

Compelx value: assuming I for the moment.

I is  unvercial there is only on value of I it has Exsitace properitie That \
is its only properity

eXt is the fundimental building block of the universe: energy-mass, \
existance, can be thought of as the \[OpenCurlyQuote]Unity\[CloseCurlyQuote] \
paritical-renononce-mass-energy

Gain the observed by multiple observations of the single enity eXt, \
projection into the Reals




 
\
\>", "Subsubsection",
